// Bun Snapshot v1, https://bun.sh/docs/test/snapshots

exports[`task_manage provider schema the description is stable and names the isolation actions 1`] = `"Manage subagents without starting a model. list: status, spend and dependencies. inspect: recent progress, output and messages; diff:true reviews isolated changes. merge: bring a direct child's reviewed isolated changes into your files, optionally selecting files. discard: retain a recovery artifact and remove a direct child's isolated checkout. message: instructions or the user's correction for a running child, at its next step (steer) or after its current work (queue). stop: end tasks, keeping partial work. resume: continue stopped, failed or interrupted children in the background. wait: until any or all task_ids end, or timeout ms. report: as a background subagent, send your parent a short note while you work. A message cannot widen a child's task or permissions."`;
